WEBVTT

00:00:08.430 --> 00:00:14.460
<i>Kakugane, the paranormal alloy forged</i> <i>from the essence of alchemy...</i>

00:00:15.640 --> 00:00:18.700
<i>Activated by the person's fighting instinct,</i>

00:00:18.970 --> 00:00:22.030
<i>the possessor converts</i> <i>their latent power into form</i>

00:00:22.480 --> 00:00:25.140
<i>and creates a weapon like no other.</i>

00:00:26.280 --> 00:00:29.080
<i>That is Buso Renkin.</i>

00:00:32.920 --> 00:00:38.590
An antidote is necessary to remove the homunculus nesting in Tokiko's body.

00:00:39.360 --> 00:00:43.630
Kazuki starts to head for the location of Chono, who possesses the antidote.

00:00:44.030 --> 00:00:47.160
But he has been wounded severely and is exhausted.

00:00:47.740 --> 00:00:51.300
Tokiko entrusts her own kakugane to Kazuki.

00:00:52.010 --> 00:00:55.570
<i>Wait for me, Tokiko!</i>
<i>Wait for me, guys!</i>

00:01:06.090 --> 00:01:08.680
<i>That's Chono's family home, huh?!</i>

00:01:09.660 --> 00:01:11.290
<i>Chono</i>
What? You don't know?

00:01:11.660 --> 00:01:14.650
After such a long time, l don't care to know where he might be.

00:01:15.060 --> 00:01:15.690
No way...

00:01:15.900 --> 00:01:19.800
With the goal of having him inherit the Chono family fortune,

00:01:19.870 --> 00:01:23.030
l gave him every conceivable kind of education for the gifted.

00:01:23.640 --> 00:01:25.070
And the investment paid off.

00:01:25.140 --> 00:01:27.910
He was brought up so well that people around us said he was

00:01:27.980 --> 00:01:31.640
on par with his great-great-grandfather who laid the foundation for this family.

00:01:32.250 --> 00:01:33.480
And now look at him!

00:01:33.850 --> 00:01:35.510
Repeating the same year twice in high school,

00:01:35.590 --> 00:01:37.180
twenty years old this year, living in seclusion!

00:01:38.990 --> 00:01:39.980
Chono!

00:01:42.960 --> 00:01:44.890
What do you think you're doing to Jiro?

00:01:45.230 --> 00:01:45.890
Jiro?

00:01:46.000 --> 00:01:49.490
That's funny that Big Brother's missing.

00:01:50.370 --> 00:01:51.700
Chono's little brother?

00:01:51.970 --> 00:01:53.230
lf you find him,

00:01:53.300 --> 00:01:57.240
tell him l decided Jiro will inherit the Chono family fortune

00:01:57.310 --> 00:01:59.070
and he is no longer needed.

00:02:00.010 --> 00:02:06.780
You're Chono's father, right?
Chono is suffering from a disease.

00:02:08.020 --> 00:02:09.420
So what?

00:02:10.290 --> 00:02:13.050
lf he can't carry out his purpose, he's just a good-for-nothing!

00:02:14.060 --> 00:02:15.920
Go home, boy.

00:02:22.070 --> 00:02:26.030
<i>The Butterfly of Black Death</i>

00:02:29.910 --> 00:02:30.970
Yeah, hello?

00:02:31.540 --> 00:02:33.980
<i>2-B Muto</i>
Oh, Big Brother. Yeah. Tokiko?

00:02:34.410 --> 00:02:37.710
lt's okay! On the Nightingale oath!

00:02:37.780 --> 00:02:40.650
l, Nurse Mahiro, will make sure to look after her!

00:02:40.980 --> 00:02:42.180
ls that her own outfit?

00:02:42.250 --> 00:02:44.240
Could it be that she just likes uniforms?

00:02:44.320 --> 00:02:47.290
By the way, the proper word is caretaker, not nurse.

00:02:47.360 --> 00:02:51.060
Geez! No interrupting!
I'll give you a shot!

00:02:51.760 --> 00:02:53.790
Chono hasn't returned to his home?

00:02:54.760 --> 00:02:57.460
ls it conceivable that his father is lying?

00:02:57.570 --> 00:02:58.590
<i>No, not a chance.</i>

00:02:59.400 --> 00:03:02.030
Even if l were Chono, l wouldn't go home.

00:03:02.640 --> 00:03:04.040
He doesn't belong here.

00:03:04.810 --> 00:03:07.280
The only place where he can turn to,

00:03:07.340 --> 00:03:10.940
is the place where it all began for him. l bet...

00:03:11.810 --> 00:03:13.540
Roger. I'll try looking.

00:03:13.620 --> 00:03:15.210
<i>Oh hey, don't run!</i>

00:03:15.280 --> 00:03:17.080
<i>You'll collapse this time for sure</i> <i>if you overdo it!</i>

00:03:17.150 --> 00:03:19.680
l'm okay...so far.

00:03:19.860 --> 00:03:20.690
<i>So far?!</i>

00:03:29.300 --> 00:03:32.200
Three and a half hours left.

00:03:33.040 --> 00:03:36.170
Come to think of it, l haven't eaten anything since yesterday.

00:03:37.170 --> 00:03:40.170
l should eat something once l've become a homunculus.

00:03:41.210 --> 00:03:42.700
l wonder what'd be good?

00:03:43.310 --> 00:03:45.710
l guess...human.

00:03:51.420 --> 00:03:53.150
l found you, Chono...

00:03:53.820 --> 00:03:54.920
You...

00:03:55.530 --> 00:03:56.420
Muto...

00:04:01.230 --> 00:04:02.860
—Chonoooo!
—Mutooooo!

00:04:05.500 --> 00:04:08.270
<i>What's wrong, Kazuki?!</i>
<i>What was that sound?!</i>

00:04:09.410 --> 00:04:12.600
Did you get excited and fall over?
What did l tell you?

00:04:12.680 --> 00:04:14.580
Tokiko, you're surprisingly energetic.

00:04:15.280 --> 00:04:18.410
l found him, Tokiko. lt's just as you suspected.

00:04:19.220 --> 00:04:22.190
His source of emotional support is the alchemy research

00:04:22.250 --> 00:04:24.280
his great-great-grandfather left behind.

00:04:24.450 --> 00:04:26.980
The storehouse where he discovered the records of that research

00:04:27.060 --> 00:04:29.750
was the final haven Chono had remaining!

00:04:31.660 --> 00:04:35.330
That you're living means Washio was defeated, huh?

00:04:35.400 --> 00:04:39.630
Yeah. He was worried about you until the very end.

00:04:40.100 --> 00:04:44.040
So what? lf he can't carry out his purpose,

00:04:44.110 --> 00:04:46.080
he's just a good-for-nothing!

00:04:46.210 --> 00:04:50.240
The antidote and the homunculus embryo.
Give them to me.

00:04:50.780 --> 00:04:52.250
I'll give you the antidote.

00:04:52.680 --> 00:04:53.980
But l can't give you this.

00:04:54.520 --> 00:04:57.080
lf l don't have this, l will die shortly from the disease.

00:04:57.420 --> 00:05:00.290
l can't let you become a homunculus like this.

00:05:01.160 --> 00:05:04.920
l vowed not to allow any more victims.

00:05:05.290 --> 00:05:06.850
<i>Talking's useless, Kazuki.</i>

00:05:07.700 --> 00:05:12.400
<i>No words can reach him now.</i>
<i>Grab the homunculus embryo quickly!</i>

00:05:13.000 --> 00:05:14.730
<i>lt's an incomplete embryo.</i>

00:05:14.800 --> 00:05:17.300
<i>lt'll die right away if you remove it</i> <i>from the culture solution.</i>

00:05:18.440 --> 00:05:22.210
Got it, Tokiko.
But just one last thing.

00:05:24.180 --> 00:05:28.310
Chono, whether you're a homunculus or a human,

00:05:28.380 --> 00:05:33.690
either way, if you die as you are now you'll be alone forever.

00:05:34.590 --> 00:05:37.120
Even if you have a grave, there'll be no flowers and no incense.

00:05:37.190 --> 00:05:38.660
So what?

00:05:39.000 --> 00:05:40.730
You won't remain in anyone's memory.

00:05:41.130 --> 00:05:43.100
Things after death don't matter!

00:05:43.730 --> 00:05:47.470
Chono! lf you pledge to make amends to the victims, I'll...!

00:05:47.840 --> 00:05:49.770
S-So...!

00:05:50.410 --> 00:05:54.340
So what?
How he dies is no concern of yours.

00:05:58.610 --> 00:06:00.910
You're a hypocrite, aren't you?

00:06:01.280 --> 00:06:02.950
What do you want, Jiro?

00:06:03.150 --> 00:06:07.390
What, you still haven't given him my father's message?

00:06:08.020 --> 00:06:12.330
About the family fortune. l'm going to be officially inheriting it.

00:06:12.960 --> 00:06:16.520
Oh that, huh?
That doesn't make any difference to me.

00:06:16.600 --> 00:06:18.300
No kidding. Really?

00:06:19.270 --> 00:06:22.500
But it's a really important thing to me.

00:06:22.940 --> 00:06:24.740
Even though l was born into the Chono family,

00:06:24.810 --> 00:06:28.270
l was always treated like your spare just for being born one year later!

00:06:28.680 --> 00:06:31.550
Ordinary education!
Ordinary school! Ordinary life!

00:06:32.180 --> 00:06:33.910
And my name is also extremely ordinary.

00:06:34.080 --> 00:06:36.310
l didn't get to have the historic character "Shaku" affixed,

00:06:36.390 --> 00:06:38.410
which is associated with our great-great-grandfather.

00:06:38.490 --> 00:06:39.550
l'm the second born, so l'm Jiro!

00:06:39.990 --> 00:06:43.620
Until you got sick, l was always the worm crawling on the ground!

00:06:43.990 --> 00:06:46.430
Then you're satisfied now, right?

00:06:47.400 --> 00:06:48.520
That's why...

00:06:48.700 --> 00:06:51.260
l can't have you recovering from your sickness now.

00:06:53.670 --> 00:06:56.470
l didn't really understand the conversation,

00:06:56.540 --> 00:06:58.840
but you'll be saved if you have this, right?

00:06:59.240 --> 00:07:00.300
Stop, you idiot!

00:07:00.440 --> 00:07:03.310
That still needs a bit of time until it's complete!

00:07:12.620 --> 00:07:15.090
Nobody needs the likes of you!

00:07:15.360 --> 00:07:16.490
You're good for nothing!

00:07:16.560 --> 00:07:19.550
This family, isn't it interesting how warped they are?

00:07:21.360 --> 00:07:22.660
You...jerk!

00:07:25.670 --> 00:07:27.400
Have you died now?

00:07:31.170 --> 00:07:34.740
C-Come...!

00:07:35.810 --> 00:07:37.140
We're the same!

00:07:37.580 --> 00:07:38.810
You should want to live...

00:07:38.880 --> 00:07:41.350
more than anyone, more than anything!

00:07:41.420 --> 00:07:44.750
Then come! Become a homunculus now!

00:07:44.820 --> 00:07:47.190
Be reborn into a glorious Papillon!

00:08:08.910 --> 00:08:09.670
Wha—?!

00:08:12.820 --> 00:08:16.550
What?! What happened?!

00:08:19.690 --> 00:08:20.680
Muto...

00:08:21.260 --> 00:08:22.820
As l recall,

00:08:22.890 --> 00:08:26.590
you said you didn't want to produce any more victims, right?

00:08:27.230 --> 00:08:28.990
Too...bad.

00:08:35.340 --> 00:08:41.140
Hmm... Black as the devil, hot as hell.

00:08:42.240 --> 00:08:44.740
Sweet as a kiss.

00:08:45.610 --> 00:08:48.080
This is the taste of humans, huh?

00:08:52.890 --> 00:08:53.950
<i>What's wrong, Kazuki?!</i>

00:08:54.390 --> 00:08:55.410
What happened?!

00:09:00.360 --> 00:09:01.730
Now l am complete.

00:09:02.300 --> 00:09:04.270
Papil...lon!

00:09:04.530 --> 00:09:06.500
Y-You pervert!

00:09:07.240 --> 00:09:11.110
Exactly! l've achieved a complete "transformation"!

00:09:17.480 --> 00:09:22.280
lt hurts a bit, but kind of feels pleasant.

00:09:24.220 --> 00:09:24.880
lt's...!

00:09:25.150 --> 00:09:27.090
lt's a monster!

00:09:29.460 --> 00:09:31.390
Not a monster, a superhuman.

00:09:38.770 --> 00:09:40.430
<i>Gunshots and screams...</i>

00:09:40.740 --> 00:09:43.330
<i>Chono turned into</i> <i>a humanoid homunculus, didn't he...?</i>

00:09:44.470 --> 00:09:45.170
<i>Sorry...</i>

00:09:45.840 --> 00:09:47.330
lt's not your fault.

00:09:47.440 --> 00:09:48.740
More importantly, get out of there immediately.

00:09:49.610 --> 00:09:52.310
<i>ln the way that people and monkeys</i> <i>are completely different,</i>

00:09:52.380 --> 00:09:55.010
<i>humanoids and animal-type homunculi</i> <i>are completely different.</i>

00:09:55.420 --> 00:09:57.610
<i>lt's not an opponent</i> <i>you can deal with now!</i>

00:10:00.890 --> 00:10:01.320
Kazuki!?

00:10:02.990 --> 00:10:05.790
l-l know! But l still...

00:10:05.900 --> 00:10:08.020
haven't gotten the antidote!

00:10:08.100 --> 00:10:09.030
<i>Just drop it, Kazuki!</i>

00:10:09.630 --> 00:10:10.830
Buso Renkin!

00:10:13.440 --> 00:10:14.170
What?!

00:10:16.140 --> 00:10:20.130
My Buso Renkin...won't activate!

00:10:26.320 --> 00:10:27.840
Game over...

00:10:29.490 --> 00:10:32.250
This body consumes a surprising amount of energy.

00:10:32.690 --> 00:10:34.710
l guess I'll fortify myself with some food first.

00:10:35.020 --> 00:10:41.360
Three hours left until twelve, until that girl turns into a homunculus.

00:10:42.060 --> 00:10:46.430
You be grief-stricken there for a while over your own powerlessness.

00:10:53.710 --> 00:10:54.440
Jiro!

00:10:54.510 --> 00:10:55.810
What's with that get-up?

00:10:58.580 --> 00:10:59.740
Jiro, eh...?

00:11:00.220 --> 00:11:02.480
Heh. Well, l'm an exact likeness, so...

00:11:06.420 --> 00:11:09.360
Hey, did you hear something just now from the porch?

00:11:09.760 --> 00:11:10.750
lt's just your imagination.

00:11:11.290 --> 00:11:15.250
l know. I'll save the ones who can tell me apart from Jiro.

00:11:15.970 --> 00:11:17.020
Let's just go.

00:11:19.900 --> 00:11:23.070
Now then, l wonder how many will figure it out.

00:11:24.610 --> 00:11:25.370
Jiro!

00:11:25.610 --> 00:11:27.340
Don't scare us like that...

00:11:31.550 --> 00:11:36.010
<i>Kazuki! Kazuki! Kazuki!</i>

00:11:36.590 --> 00:11:38.820
<i>Answer me, Kazuki!</i>

00:11:39.460 --> 00:11:40.580
<i>Kazuki?!</i>

00:11:41.020 --> 00:11:43.960
<i>Can you hear me? Hey, Kazuki!</i>

00:11:44.690 --> 00:11:45.420
Kazuki!

00:11:45.790 --> 00:11:47.560
<i>l can hear you, Tokiko.</i>

00:11:48.260 --> 00:11:52.290
So you finally woke up, huh?
Get out of there now!

00:11:52.870 --> 00:11:55.100
l can still, fight.

00:11:55.300 --> 00:11:57.570
<i>lmpossible!</i>
<i>You're only finally able to move</i>

00:11:57.640 --> 00:12:00.440
<i>due to the healing effects</i> <i>of two kakugane.</i>

00:12:01.180 --> 00:12:03.740
<i>Leave Chono to the replacement warrior.</i>

00:12:04.180 --> 00:12:06.080
Then the antidote won't be in time!

00:12:06.150 --> 00:12:07.050
<i>Enough already!</i>

00:12:07.880 --> 00:12:12.410
You've done more than enough. l'm prepared.

00:12:13.720 --> 00:12:16.820
<i>Get back here quick.</i>
<i>Everyone's waiting.</i>

00:12:17.990 --> 00:12:20.930
Tokiko, put Mahiro and the others on.

00:12:21.260 --> 00:12:21.700
Huh?

00:12:22.460 --> 00:12:23.660
l peeled some apples!

00:12:24.270 --> 00:12:26.670
Strawberry talk is temporarily suspended!

00:12:27.240 --> 00:12:30.100
Kazuki! Do you need some backup after all?!

00:12:30.440 --> 00:12:33.140
Yeah! I'll show you this ducktail's true power!

00:12:33.680 --> 00:12:35.840
Right. l want to see it.

00:12:36.250 --> 00:12:41.980
Oh, Kazuki. l hid the "Lewd and Pretty Ladies Maximum"

00:12:42.050 --> 00:12:43.880
you had under your bed.

00:12:44.120 --> 00:12:48.320
l moved it. There'll be a huge uproar if Tokiko or Mahiro finds it.

00:12:48.390 --> 00:12:50.360
You saved me there, Daihama.

00:12:51.290 --> 00:12:54.590
For the time being, come back through the back, Kazuki.

00:12:54.930 --> 00:12:58.260
The dorm advisor's got his eyes on you, so don't screw up.

00:12:58.870 --> 00:13:02.530
Right. lf push comes to shove, answer at roll call for me.

00:13:05.110 --> 00:13:08.130
<i>Big Brother? Tokiko will be fine.</i>

00:13:08.210 --> 00:13:09.180
<i>Leave it to me, leave it to me.</i>

00:13:09.810 --> 00:13:11.780
We're all having some apples together.

00:13:12.380 --> 00:13:14.980
There won't be any left if you don't come back quickly.

00:13:15.620 --> 00:13:20.820
Save some for me. l can't go back right away, so...

00:13:21.390 --> 00:13:22.290
Kazuki...

00:13:22.890 --> 00:13:24.380
<i>l'm okay, Tokiko.</i>

00:13:25.390 --> 00:13:27.020
Hearing everyone's voices...

00:13:27.100 --> 00:13:29.260
l feel like it's really giving me strength.

00:13:30.270 --> 00:13:34.260
<i>I'll get the antidote and be back for sure.</i>
<i>Wait and believe in me.</i>

00:13:36.410 --> 00:13:39.670
<i>And I'll be borrowing some</i> <i>of your strength.</i>

00:13:41.310 --> 00:13:44.040
Jiro's—! Jiro's turned into a monster!

00:13:45.110 --> 00:13:45.810
Kill it!

00:13:45.980 --> 00:13:48.040
Fire, fire!

00:13:51.720 --> 00:13:53.690
Not a single one... Eh?

00:13:55.290 --> 00:13:56.350
How noisy!

00:13:56.660 --> 00:13:58.060
What're they playing around with?!

00:14:02.870 --> 00:14:03.920
Dad.

00:14:06.670 --> 00:14:12.130
Ooh... Ooh! What a lovely style.
What party is it tonight?

00:14:12.210 --> 00:14:13.000
Jiro!

00:14:16.710 --> 00:14:17.770
Let's see...

00:14:17.980 --> 00:14:22.010
A "memorial to the deceased
Koshaku Chono" party, as it were.

00:14:22.420 --> 00:14:25.080
Jiroo...!

00:14:30.660 --> 00:14:35.390
What, so Koshaku Chono didn't die tonight,

00:14:35.460 --> 00:14:38.090
but has been dead for ages, huh?

00:14:39.440 --> 00:14:42.200
Then now will be the after-party!

00:14:45.770 --> 00:14:48.680
lt's the birth festival of the homunculus, Papillon!

00:14:51.110 --> 00:14:54.410
lt's a world that didn't need this Koshaku Chono anyway!

00:14:54.720 --> 00:14:56.950
I'll set it all on fire and burn it down!

00:14:57.950 --> 00:15:01.450
I'll light a bonfire befitting of this icy dark night!

00:15:01.660 --> 00:15:03.590
A super huge bonfire!

00:15:03.660 --> 00:15:04.990
l won't let you do such a thing!

00:15:05.860 --> 00:15:09.420
You, huh? l told you to give in to your despair.

00:15:09.500 --> 00:15:10.230
Chono!

00:15:10.570 --> 00:15:11.630
What?!

00:15:13.300 --> 00:15:14.430
My kakugane?!

00:15:14.740 --> 00:15:16.570
<i>I'll be borrowing some of your strength.</i>

00:15:17.940 --> 00:15:21.880
Double Buso Renkin!

00:15:25.210 --> 00:15:27.380
l'm going to settle this, Chono!

00:15:27.450 --> 00:15:28.110
Bring it!

00:15:29.720 --> 00:15:31.350
So your wounds healed? Huh?!

00:15:33.660 --> 00:15:37.890
Double Tomahawk.
No, Double Lance, huh?

00:15:38.460 --> 00:15:41.230
However, can you now use it skillfully?

00:15:42.230 --> 00:15:44.960
Covered with wounds, exhausted.

00:15:45.500 --> 00:15:47.090
Your precious Double Lance,

00:15:47.170 --> 00:15:49.970
unstable to the extent that it looks like it'll fall apart right away.

00:15:50.370 --> 00:15:51.770
You attempting to beat me like that,

00:15:51.840 --> 00:15:53.670
it's so funny l feel like l'm going to burst out laughing!

00:15:58.050 --> 00:16:00.710
<i>Kazuki, what was that nasty sound</i> <i>just now?</i>

00:16:01.380 --> 00:16:02.750
Chono coughed up blood.

00:16:03.550 --> 00:16:05.020
<i>Does Chono have an emblem mark?</i>

00:16:05.520 --> 00:16:07.720
Come to think of it, there isn't one anywhere...

00:16:08.120 --> 00:16:10.460
<i>l see. Listen carefully, Kazuki.</i>

00:16:10.890 --> 00:16:12.420
<i>No, Chono!</i>

00:16:13.330 --> 00:16:15.130
Your transformation has failed!

00:16:15.230 --> 00:16:18.390
Using an embryo before completion caused something to go wrong.

00:16:19.570 --> 00:16:23.130
You turned into a homunculus while retaining your diseased body!

00:16:24.010 --> 00:16:25.870
With an immortal and diseased body,

00:16:25.940 --> 00:16:29.640
you'll continue to experience pain and suffering semi-permanently.

00:16:30.610 --> 00:16:33.210
That's your retribution for attempting to lengthen your life,

00:16:33.280 --> 00:16:34.910
going so far as to sacrifice...

00:16:35.650 --> 00:16:37.240
<i>the lives of many.</i>

00:16:37.590 --> 00:16:39.610
l failed.

00:16:40.820 --> 00:16:43.220
But l've still got a chance.

00:16:43.530 --> 00:16:47.660
See, l've got one more new life in front of my eyes!

00:16:48.430 --> 00:16:51.630
The antidote is in the box in the back of the incubator.

00:16:51.800 --> 00:16:52.960
lt'll explode instantly

00:16:53.040 --> 00:16:55.130
if you try to force it open with anything other than this key.

00:16:58.070 --> 00:16:58.900
Now, bring it!

00:16:59.110 --> 00:17:01.200
I'll eat you, get the kakugane,

00:17:01.280 --> 00:17:05.740
and with the woman turned into a homunculus, I'll burn this world down!

00:17:05.810 --> 00:17:07.250
l won't let you do any of that!

00:17:07.620 --> 00:17:09.280
I'll defeat you!

00:17:09.420 --> 00:17:10.010
Kazuki!

00:17:10.090 --> 00:17:12.450
This is the final blow!

00:17:13.920 --> 00:17:15.720
The kakugane is mine.

00:17:41.520 --> 00:17:45.890
lmpossible! Although incomplete, l'm still superhuman.

00:17:45.990 --> 00:17:47.650
How could a human like you...

00:17:48.160 --> 00:17:49.680
l'm just a human...

00:17:50.290 --> 00:17:53.590
But l've made it through life-or-death battles and made it here.

00:17:55.430 --> 00:18:00.160
Heh. So, what good will it do you, who have gotten stronger, to beat me?

00:18:00.340 --> 00:18:01.960
l've become a homunculus,

00:18:02.040 --> 00:18:04.600
l can't return to normal and l can't stop eating people.

00:18:04.910 --> 00:18:06.210
To say nothing of the fact that

00:18:06.280 --> 00:18:08.240
the key to that woman's antidote is in this stomach.

00:18:08.880 --> 00:18:11.140
Will you wait for it to come out with my excrement?

00:18:11.810 --> 00:18:14.750
Now, what will you do with me?

00:18:16.720 --> 00:18:18.120
What will you do?!

00:18:19.790 --> 00:18:20.380
Forgive me.

00:18:21.120 --> 00:18:22.280
Koshaku Chono.

00:18:23.860 --> 00:18:27.690
<i>Oh... my name!</i>

00:18:31.600 --> 00:18:33.900
Don't apologize, hypocrite!

00:18:56.660 --> 00:18:57.590
The key...

00:19:00.730 --> 00:19:05.390
The key. Tokiko...

00:19:28.420 --> 00:19:32.260
<i>Light. The morning sun?</i>

00:19:32.790 --> 00:19:33.350
<i>Morning?!</i>

00:19:33.800 --> 00:19:35.530
<i>Oh! Oh!</i>

00:19:39.640 --> 00:19:45.100
Kazuki, did you know... that if you look from close up,

00:19:45.170 --> 00:19:49.910
your Buso Renkin energy is a bright yellow, a lot like sunlight?

00:19:50.780 --> 00:19:52.840
lt was quite late in coming,

00:19:52.910 --> 00:19:57.940
but how about "Sunlight Heart" for the name of your lance?

00:19:58.890 --> 00:19:59.860
Tokiko!

00:20:04.490 --> 00:20:09.860
Thank you, Kazuki.
Now the mission is complete.

00:20:14.490 --> 00:20:16.460
The Mysterious Organization begins their move.

00:20:16.530 --> 00:20:19.730
This is the true power of the Humanoid Homunculus?

00:20:20.070 --> 00:20:21.660
A new battle begins...!

00:20:22.570 --> 00:20:26.030
Next time, "Whether or Not You're a Hypocrite"

00:20:26.200 --> 00:20:27.930
I'll splatter your guts out!
